    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nhama iku'mi zyamwa Mulungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulungu wayombile mihayo zyose zyeni'zi ati', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ene ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wako, u'yo naku'fumizye ku'fuma ku' nsi' ya Misili, u'ko wav'age musese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku'du' u'v'e na milungu zingi' sumbwa ene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku'du' wiv'ezezye ki'mbulimbuli, ninga ki'ntu' cha wikole na ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo i'cho ki'li' mu igu'lya mu chelela, ninga i'cho ki'li' ha nsi'li'li' ha welelo, ninga i'cho ki'li' mu minzi' ha nsi'li'li' ya welelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'du' u'viku'v'i'i'le ninga ku'vitu'mami'la, ku'nguno ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wako, ni' Mulungu wa iwu'v'a. Nu'v'asali'kya v'ana wu'kenagu'zi wa v'asav'o, ninga wu'v'yalwa wa wu'datu' na wa wu'ne wa av'o v'angayile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi nu'lagi'la chelu' ku' wu'v'yalwa mahu'ya wa v'antu' av'o v'antogilwe na ku'ziku'zya nhama zyanne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku'du' u'li'kanie gele lina lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wako. Ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu akasye aleke ku'muv'azi'zya ihu'v'yo muntu' u'yo ali'li'kania lina lyakwe gele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yi'li'ku'dima u'lwizu'ki'le lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho u'lo lu'li' Sabato, na ku'lu'v'ezya lu'sondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugati' na nsiku' mukaga, u'latu'mame na ku'v'ezya magambo gako gose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sumbwa lu'siku' lwa mupungati' lwenu'lo lu'li' lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wako. Lu'siku' lwenu'lo u'leke ku'tu'mama muli'mo ninga gu'mo, ev'e, mwana wako, wa ki'gosya ninga wa ki'ki'ma, haki'mo na mukumba wako na muzya wako, ninga ndimu yako ya ku'sav'a, haki'mo na mugeni u'yo ali' mu kaya yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno ku' nsiku' mukaga Gu'ku' Mulungu watundaga ilunde, li'welelo, nyanza na vyose i'vyo vili' mu welelo yose, na lu'siku' lwa mupungati' wasuuhaga. Ku'nguno yeni'yo Gu'ku' Mulungu walu'dosyaga lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho, na ku'lu'v'ezya lu'sondo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
