            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku'du' u'yigomelwe nnumba ya mwiyo. Ku'du' u'mwigomelwe muki' wa mwiyo, ninga mukumba wakwe, muzya wakwe, ng'ombe yakwe, mpunda yakwe, ninga ki'ntu' ki'mo i'cho ali'nacho muntu' mwiyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'antu' v'ose aho v'igwaga ngilimo na ku'wona wu'meku'le wa nku'v'a, na kwigwa muzwi gwa milangale, na ku'wona lu'gu'lu' lu'li'zuka lyonsi, v'ose v'atetemaga ku' wov'a. Haho v'ose v'i'maga ku'le ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ku'muwi'la Mose ati', “Yomba niswe ev'e mweni'ki'li', niswe ku'ku'ku'degeleka. Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'du' u'muleke ayombe niswe, ki'gele ku'du' ku'fwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Muleke kogoha, ku'nguno Mulungu wizaga ku'mugema, ki'gele muv'e na wov'a wa Mulungu na muleke ku'v'ezya wu'kenagu'zi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
