        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose walyegelaga lyeni'lo ilunde lya giti ntimbu, i'lo Mulungu wav'age ali' mwenu'mo. Itungo lyeni'lo v'antu' v'ose v'i'maga ku'le.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ki'v'ezezye cha ihozezyo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli i'vi: ‘Inywe v'eni'ki'li' mwiwonelelaga ku'v'a nayombaga na inywe ku'fuma ku' ilunde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'du' mwiv'ezezye vimbulimbuli ku'v'a milungu zya ku'ngelani'zya ene, ziv'e zya mawe ga feza ninga zahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulambezezye ihozezyo lya wu'longo, na ha igu'lya yalyo mulanfumi'zye vitaambo vya ku'zigya na vitaambo vya kwiswanania, vya ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li zinywe. Ki'la lwandi' u'lo ndahav'ezye lina lyanne li'kumu'kiwe, hene haho ndize na ku'mudosya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na inywe u'lu' mwanzyengela ihozezyo lya mawe, ku'du' mwize muzyengele mawe ga ku'pu'nza, ku'nguno u'lu' mutu'mi'le vilwani'lo vinywe vya ku'pu'nzi'la mawe, mulav'e mwali'v'ezezya zoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' ku'du' mwize muv'ezye ihozezyo i'lo li'li' na itandi'zyo lya ku'liini'la, ki'gele ku'du' ize asigale du'u'hu' ha igu'lya yalyo.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
